<title>FRANCE: France to offer 14 bln Ffr of T-bills Monday.</title>
<headline>France to offer 14 bln Ffr of T-bills Monday.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French Treasury said it would offer 14 billion francs of bills at its next weekly tender on Monday, November 4.</p>
<p>The offering will comprise 3 billion francs of 4-week bills, 8 billion francs of 13-week bills and 3 billion francs of 26-week paper.</p>
<p>Payment for the 4-week paper and the 13-week paper is due on November 11. Payment for the 26-week bills is due on November 14.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
